  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving Trafficking in Person (TIP) Referral Outcome in Comoros and Mauritius</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is formulated around one objective and is informed by the &#x201C;3P&#x201D; paradigm of prosecuting traffickers through victim-centered law enforcement; protecting victims of trafficking through proactive identification and comprehensive care services; and preventing trafficking in persons (TiP). This project&apos;s goal is to contribute to key national governments and civil society&apos;s efforts in Comoros and Mauritius to combating TIP, by improving the referral outcome.</narrative>
  </description>
